--------------------Phase 10 — Parallel Development Strategy------------------------

A major objective during backend development was preventing one team member's unfinished component from blocking the other developers.

A mock facial-recognition implementation was therefore introduced.

Currently:

Student Image
     ↓
Backend
     ↓
Mock Recognition
     ↓
Test Student Identified
     ↓
Enrollment Validation
     ↓
Duplicate Validation
     ↓
Attendance Record

Later, only the recognition component needs to change:

Student Image
     ↓
Backend
     ↓
REAL CompreFace
     ↓
Student Identified
     ↓
Enrollment Validation
     ↓
Duplicate Validation
     ↓
Attendance Record

This allows the attendance logic and frontend integration to be tested before the real facial-recognition implementation is complete.

